---
title: Impossible Pie
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 40 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@eggs{4}
@flour{0.5%cup}
@milk{2%cups}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@salt{0.25%tsp}
@melted butter{0.25%cup}
@coconut{1.5%cups}
@nutmeg

Put in blender and blend for 2 minutes. Then put in a glass pie pan. Bake at 350 degrees for 40 minutes. Sprinkle nutmeg on top before baking.
